  "matching_notes": "Auxiliary CIK disagreements affect 5335 of 310920 main-sample reviews. Largest examples have corroborated issuer names/GVKEYs and SEC financial CIKs; an auxiliary-ID mismatch is not automatically a wrong company link. Excluding conflicts and matching root-employer posting/review scope did not establish attenuation. Current-root scope is not dated historical ownership.",
